 gyro → stick options" /></ctk:SettingsCard.Header><ToggleButton x:Name="ViiperStickGyroAdvancedToggle" IsChecked="False" VerticalAlignment="Center" Background="Transparent" BorderThickness="0" Padding="8,4" Click="ViiperStickGyroAdvancedToggle_Click"> <FontIcon x:Name="ViiperStickGyroAdvancedIcon" Glyph="&#xE70D;" FontSize="13"/> </ToggleButton></ctk:SettingsCard><StackPanel x:Name="ViiperStickGyroAdvancedContent" Visibility="Collapsed"><ctk:SettingsCard x:Uid="S_SendToJoystick_2" Header="Send to joystick" Description="Which emulated stick receives the gyro contribution.">
